    [1;34m"body"[m[1;37m:[m [32m"## Problem\n\nThe role table is open on both ends now (#3472, commit `df89681`), but **no\nproducer fills it** — the seam ships unwired, which is the shape AGENTS.md\n§ \"Nothing left behind\" asks to be tracked explicitly.\n\nWhat exists after that commit:\n\n- `crates/stella-pipeline/src/roster.rs` — `RoleTable` (`contribute` /\n  `withdraw` / `resolve` / `names`), `RoleTableError`, and\n  `Roster::with_roles(RoleTable)`. `Roster::role`, `Roster::validate` and\n  `Roster::independence_losses` all resolve through it.\n- `crates/stella-tui/src/envelope/roles.rs` — `role_table(state, known)`\n  folds `EngineConfigState::roles` into render order; a row whose key the deck\n  has no word for is rendered after the built-ins, labelled by its own key.\n  `crates/stella-tui/src/views/models_card.rs` renders that fold.\n\nWhat does not exist:\n\n1. **Nothing calls `Roster::with_roles`.** Every construction site\n   (`crates/stella-cli/src/settings/engine.rs`, `resume_frame.rs`,\n   `PipelineConfig` literals) still builds a roster over the five built-ins,\n   so a contributed name is `RosterError::UnknownAgent` in every real run\n   today. Correct and fail-closed, but inert.\n2. **No manifest declares a role.** `crates/stella-plugin/src/wrapper.rs`\n   parses the `[wrapper]` block (#3381); a role declaration — a name plus the\n   tier it rides, and nothing else (never a model, endpoint or credential) —\n   has no home in it yet.\n3. **No driver emits a contributed `RoleWiringRow`.** `stella-cli`'s\n   `config_wiring` / `engine_config.rs` build the rows from\n   `EngineRole::ALL`, so the deck can render a contributed row but never\n   receives one.\n4. **No provenance on the row.** #3472's definition of done asks for a row\n   attributed to the plugin that declared it. Today the deck labels a\n   contributed row by its own key and leans on the pre-rendered `source` cell\n   (`from …`). Adding an explicit contributor field to `RoleWiringRow` is an\n   envelope-contract change plus a driver change; note that\n   `crates/stella-tui/src/envelope.rs` is at **1496 of its 1500-line ceiling**\n   (see the sibling issue), so the field's docs may not fit there.\n\n## Verify\n\n- `cargo test -p stella-pipeline --lib roster` — the two contribution\n  witnesses (`a_contributed_role_resolves_and_stops_resolving_when_it_is_withdrawn`,\n  `a_contributed_role_cannot_launder_the_worker_into_the_verifier_seat`).\n- `cargo test -p stella-tui --lib envelope::roles` and\n  `views::models_card::tests::a_contributed_role_is_printed_and_leaves_with_its_contributor`.\n\n## Constraints already discovered\n\n- **Built-ins are not redefinable** (`RoleTableError::ShadowsBuiltin`), and\n  that refusal is load-bearing: repointing `verifier` at the worker's tier\n  turns the default roster's own `witness_author` into self-grading with no\n  configuration changing. A host that \"merges\" a contribution over a built-in\n  reintroduces exactly that.\n- **A contribution may only name a pipeline tier** — media tiers are refused\n  (`NotAPipelineTier`), matching `AgentId::BUILTIN`'s existing exclusion.\n- **Independence is compared on resolved tiers, not names.** Any future path\n  that resolves a contributed name outside `RoleTable::resolve` re-opens the\n  bypass; there is deliberately one resolver (`AgentId::builtin_role` is\n  private for this reason).\n- `crates/stella-tui/src/views/engine.rs` and `src/views/session.rs` are\n  grandfathered god files closed to growth.\n- Deck golden frames: `BLESS=1 cargo test -p stella-tui --test deck_render_snapshots`,\n  and read the diff.\n\n## Done when\n\n- A plugin manifest declaring a role produces a `/models` row attributed to\n  that plugin, with no change to `stella-tui`.\n- Uninstalling it removes the row, and a roster still bound to it refuses the\n  run by name before any spend.\n- A configuration declaring no plugins is byte-identical to today's default\n  path (the `the_default_roster_is_the_pipeline_that_shipped` property still\n  holds).\n- `make gate` green, no baseline entry added to `scripts/file-size-baseline.txt`.\n\nRefs #3472, #3380, #3408"[m[1;37m,[m
    [1;34m"number"[m[1;37m:[m 3492[1;37m,[m
    [1;34m"title"[m[1;37m:[m [32m"Nothing contributes a role yet: wire RoleTable and the /models row list to the plugin host"[m
  [1;37m}[m[1;37m,[m
