    [1;34m"body"[m[1;37m:[m [32m"## Problem\n\n`glob` with an absolute pattern (`/app/**/*`, `/app/*`) silently returns `(no files found)` instead of matching or erroring. Measured 2026-08-10 (`kv-store-grpc__RpPZcUD` S1–S9): six differently-argued glob calls all returned the same empty answer, which then made the loop detector fire ON THE TOOL'S BUG (\"the last 6 glob calls used DIFFERENT arguments but every one returned byte-identical output\"), costing a steering interrupt.\n\nDownstream, this loses path-tracing outright (2/16 cells): `/app` contains a compiled reference renderer `orig` that CC-on-GLM found with a step-1 `ls -la` and disassembled (`strings`/`nm`/`objdump`) to reconstruct the scene, passing in 33 steps. Stella never listed `/app` (globs returned empty), never saw `orig`, and spent 46-59 steps / ~1800s curve-fitting raw pixels to similarity 0.97.\n\n## Fix\n\n1. `glob`: support absolute patterns and `dir/**`; a pattern the tool cannot handle returns an ERROR, never a silent empty.\n2. Turn-0 inventory: a working recursive listing of the session root with file types (`project_overview` returned all-nulls on pypi-server — fix or replace it).\n3. Prompt rule: before analysing the artifact the task names, list the working directory — a binary/reference next to the data is usually the intended oracle.\n4. Ship or shim `file`/`xxd`/`ps`/`pgrep` in the tool layer (missing in ~every task image; cost a discovery step in 9 trials).\n\n## Done looks like\n\n`glob \"/app/**/*\"` lists /app; a path-tracing-shaped trial's transcript shows the reference binary discovered in the first 3 steps; witness at the tool level (absolute-pattern glob returns matches; unsupported pattern returns an error).\n\nFiles: glob tool in `crates/stella-tools`. Evidence: `turnloop-cert-panel1` kv/path-tracing transcripts vs `ccglm-bar-B` path-tracing.\n"[m[1;37m,[m
    [1;34m"number"[m[1;37m:[m 2669[1;37m,[m
    [1;34m"title"[m[1;37m:[m [32m"P3: glob silently returns empty for absolute patterns — never inventoried /app, lost path-tracing (2/16 cells), and tripped the loop detector on its own bug"[m
  [1;37m}[m[1;37m,[m
